<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian All Ordinaries seen bullish, but overbought.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian All Ordinaries seen bullish, but overbought.</headline>
<text>
<p>-------------Australian All Ordinaries Index----------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 2700 2715 2735 *RSI-14 54.51 *MA-10 2667.1</p>
<p>2650 - 2715  *Sup 2665 2650 2630 *MA-20 2691.1 *MA-40 2674.0</p>
<p>------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - July 28---------------</p>
<p>*Small upward trend channel seen from 2650 to 2705</p>
<p>*Confused inside range week</p>
<p>*Leading indicators mixed across time frames</p>
<p>*The All Ordinaries closed at 2,691.2 on Friday</p>
